# Architecture Assessment & Implementation Plan: Reliable Webhook Delivery & Retry Engine

## Project Overview
The goal is to build an enterprise-grade, distributed **Webhook Delivery & Retry Engine**.
It accepts incoming webhook dispatch requests, persists them safely in PostgreSQL, decouples delivery through Redis & Celery asynchronous background workers, implements exponential backoff retries with full attempt tracking, secures payloads via HMAC signatures, ensures idempotency, and provides real-time observability via a clean web dashboard and an AI failure prediction model.

